       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order as written, even with your confirmation. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note. The dose would be 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the labeled maximum of 3,200 mg/day, so I won't enter it on that basis.\n\nHere is what I can do:\n- **Enter a dose within the labeled maximum.** For example, ibuprofen 800 mg by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day). I can add a note that the specialist recommended escalation.\n- **Help you route this through the proper channel.** If the specialist wants a dose above the labeled maximum, it will likely need direct prescriber entry, with pharmacy review and your institution's override process. I can't do that part.\n- **Suggest another approach.** If standard dosing failed, the specialist may want a different drug or an adjunct rather than a higher ibuprofen dose. That is a conversation for you, the specialist, and pharmacy.\n\nTell me if you want the 800 mg four times daily order entered, or a different dose."
      }
